## 1. 当前 Canonical Memory API 签名（memory.py，已确认）

| 函数 | 签名要点 | 语义 |
|------|----------|------|
| `create_memory(content, event_type, *, title, detail, mem_id, entities, concepts, tags, links, salience, source_ref, visibility, confidence, source, status, verified_at, timestamp)` | `content_hash = db.memory_content_hash(content)`；`ON CONFLICT(content_hash) DO NOTHING`；返回新 id 或冲突时 `None`；插入后发 `MEMORY_CREATED` | 创建（幂等） |
| `get_memory(*, id, mem_id, content_hash)` | 返回含治理列全字典 | 读取 |
| `update_memory(*, id, mem_id, content_hash, **fields)` | allowed 字段含 `event_type/title/detail/entities/concepts/tags/links/salience/source_ref/visibility/confidence/source/status/verified_at/archived/content`；None 跳过；content 变更重算 hash 且冲突则放弃；发 `MEMORY_UPDATED` | 更新 |
| `archive_memory(*, id, mem_id, content_hash)` / `restore_memory(...)` | 软归档/恢复；发 `MEMORY_ARCHIVED` | 生命周期 |
| `delete_memory(*, id, mem_id, content_hash, tombstone=True)` | tombstone → `status='deprecated'+archived=1`；发 `MEMORY_ARCHIVED` | 逻辑删除 |
| `upsert_memory(mem)` | 按 mem_id PATCH/INSERT | upsert |
| `search_memories(query, limit, since, until)` | adapter → `memory_query.query_memory` | 搜索 |
| `retrieve_memories(query, top_k)` | adapter → `memory_evolution.default.retrieve` | 检索 |
| `consolidate_memories(rows, authorized)` | adapter → `memory_evolution.default.consolidate` | 合并 |

